sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 玩家
  participant A as App(mode='ai')
  participant H as useAiGame
  participant P as aiGame(纯函数)
  participant D as searchDriver
  participant S as AiSession(core)
  participant C as core(applyMove/currentColor)

  Note over A: 模式切换为纯视图态，联机 game 不动
  U->>A: 点击棋盘 (x,y)
  A->>H: play(x,y)
  H->>H: 守卫：thinking / over / 非玩家回合 → 忽略
  H->>P: applyPlayerMove(game, x, y, playerColor)
  P->>C: applyMove(...)
  C-->>P: MoveResult（win/draw/move）
  P-->>H: game'
  H-->>U: setGame(game') 重渲染（棋盘 + 棋谱 + 音效）
  H->>H: effect：!over && currentColor(game') !== playerColor
  H-->>U: setThinking(true) 渲染「AI 正在思考…」(aria-live)
  H->>D: runSearchSharded(game', aiColor, DIFFICULTY_PRESETS[d], {sliceMs:32})
  D->>S: createSearchSession(game', aiColor, opts)
  Note right of S: fromGameState 全量重建 + tt.clear()<br/>开局策略 → 硬规则短路 → VCF → 迭代加深
  loop 每 32ms 一片（首片在 thinking 上屏之后）
    D->>S: step(32)
    S-->>D: true（仍有工作）
    D->>D: schedule(setTimeout 0) 让出主线程
  end
  S-->>D: step() === false
  D-->>H: onDone(point, stats)
  H->>P: applyAiMove(game', point, aiColor)
  P->>C: applyMove(...)
  C-->>P: MoveResult
  P-->>H: game''
  H-->>U: setGame(game'') + setThinking(false) → AI 子高亮 + 轮到我

  Note over U,H: 悔棋：undoPair → 退 2 步 → currentColor === playerColor
  Note over U,H: 切回联机：mode='online'，取消在跑 session，aiGame 原样保留
